  "description_short": "Community cafe in Pacaltsdorp serving hearty breakfasts, fresh coffee, and home-style meals with local warmth.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away in Pacaltsdorp, Front Door Cafe is a welcoming neighborhood spot where locals gather for good coffee and honest home-cooked food. The menu focuses on breakfast favorites and daily lunch specials, all prepared with care in a relaxed, down-to-earth setting.\n\nThis is the kind of place where you'll find generous portions, friendly faces, and prices that won't break the bank. Whether you're stopping in for a morning coffee and something freshly baked, or settling in for a proper sit-down meal, the cafe delivers straightforward comfort food in a community atmosphere. It's a genuine taste of everyday George life, away from the tourist trail.",
